venerable-demon-chef:
Mo Qi has no talent for Cultivation, yet possesses knife skills that even a Grandmaster cannot match,
A single strand of hair, He can split into 13,600 threads;
Never having practiced Body Refining, just by cooking and chopping firewood daily for the 100,000 people of the Sect, he can toss a 10,000-jin spoon with one hand;
He doesn't know Alchemy, yet can stir-fry plate after plate of top-grade Elixirs. May I ask if you need a chicken-flavored Divine Tempering Pill, or a beef-flavored one?
“By the way, combat is just my hobby; being a chef is my true profession.”
